s_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d726f57b5bc2eecb96a932b40c30262ab381cc1e", "message": "Add KPD liberation decisions, flags & focus tweaks\n\nIntroduce a new KPD decision set and category for 'liberation of Europe' (common/decisions/KPD.txt and categories), plus a decision-category icon and UI sprite. Add multiple flag assets for KPD_greater_proletarian_german_state (small/medium/full) and cosmetic country entry with color, and add Korean localisation strings for the new tag and faction/manifest names. Wire up faction manifest (BA_liberation_of_all_europe) and switch the KPD faction template to use it. Add dynamic modifier mappings for politburo industrial capacity and extend BA faction manifests scaling. Add scripted effects (annex test and politburo tooltip change), several national focus adjustments (multiple cost reductions, focus completion changes including adding cores for BA trinity states, setting cosmetic tag, event guard conditions and a country flag), and minor GUI registration for the decision category. Overall these changes implement KPD liberation mechanics, UI/asset support and balance/tuning for related focus trees.", "created_at": "2026-02-19T13:04:49Z", "repo": "Archive_MOD", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5f2e144c43676793754ca0c42b337417e218a27c", "message": "Add KPD army dynamic modifiers and UI\n\nIntroduce multiple KPD army dynamic modifiers, related focuses, scripted effect, localisation and UI assets. Changes include:\n\n- common/dynamic_modifiers: add new KPD dynamic modifiers (national_peoples_army, national_defense_force, citizens_in_uniform, prussian_army, expanded prussian/national variants) and switch icons to new GFX entries.\n- common/national_focus/KPD.txt: adjust focus layout and rewards, add new army-related focuses that swap/assign the new dynamic modifiers, tweak variables (conscription value, mobilization, etc.) and replace some completion effects to call the new scripted effect KPD_modify_army.\n- common/scripted_effects: add KPD_modify_army scripted effect to manage adding/displaying the appropriate dynamic modifier tooltip and initial assignment.\n- common/scripted_localisation: add and reorganise Korean localisation keys and tooltips for the new modifiers and swaps.\n- gfx/interface and interface/BlueArchive: add new idea icon TGA files and register spriteTypes for each new modifier icon.\n- Small numeric/tooltip tweaks (focus position Y adjusted, conscription factor tweak, idea swap change to use SOV_politicized_military_swap).\n\nThese changes add configurable army-style national spirits for KPD and update UI/tooltip support so players can pick and evolve army doctrines.", "created_at": "2026-02-18T23:00:05Z", "repo": "Archive_MOD", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "819c3e6b46a1d6a0425aba1f37c6fca190c66826", "message": "DEBUG", "created_at": "2026-02-18T13:30:41Z", "repo": "Archive_MOD", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4a4cf07342c8cb206caca8306b175aa8f945bc71", "message": "\uc77c\ub2e8 \ub9cc\ub9c8\uc804 \uc5f0\uad00\ub9cc \uc0b4\uc9dd \uc9c0\uc6cc\ubcfc\uae4c", "created_at": "2026-02-18T11:56:00Z", "repo": "Archive_MOD", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e3d4732baf6772141eca2851c6db35462ceaf0e", "message": "Update BA_scripted_effects.txt", "created_at": "2026-02-18T11:52:22Z", "repo": "Archive_MOD", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "be932529a71ac9142559afb400a72c7a5545c4e0", "message": "\ub098\ub294 \ubaa8\ub4dc\ub97c \ubc18\uc73c\ub85c \uac08\ub790\ub2e4", "created_at": "2026-02-18T11:47:26Z", "repo": "Archive_MOD", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1e761c938b206486934c29c8de2d0bc6848350b7", "message": "Merge branch 'AAT-patch' into \uc2e0\ube44-\uc9c1\uc870\uae30", "created_at": "2026-02-18T11:07:50Z", "repo": "